        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Bakudō #61. Six thin rods of light slam into the midsection from six directions and hold it there.</em></p><p>One creature within 30 feet attempts a Fortitude save.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> It is <strong>immobilized</strong> and can't use manipulate actions for 1 round.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, for 2 rounds.</p><hr /><p><em>Deliberately without the incapacitation trait, which is why it stops at \"no manipulate actions\" rather than at paralysed.</em></p>"
